sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Owner
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Django API
    participant C as Community
    participant AU as Authority
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/PostGIS

    O->>FE: File theft report
    FE->>API: POST /api/reports/
    API->>DB: Save report (new_case)
    API->>NS: Notify authority/community (city scoped)

    C->>FE: Submit sighting
    FE->>API: POST /api/sightings/
    API->>DB: Save sighting + run fuzzy match
    API->>NS: Notify owner handshake (+ urgent if high confidence)

    O->>FE: Confirm sighting (yes/no/not_sure)
    FE->>API: PUT /api/sightings/{id}/owner-confirm/
    API->>NS: Escalate to authority on yes

    AU->>FE: Update case status
    FE->>API: PUT /api/reports/{id}/status/
    API->>DB: Transition status

    AU->>FE: Log recovery
    FE->>API: POST /api/reports/{id}/recovery/
    API->>DB: Save recovery and update status
    API->>NS: Notify owner

    O->>FE: Confirm bike receipt
    FE->>API: PUT /api/reports/{id}/recovery/confirm/
    API->>DB: Close case
    API->>NS: Notify community contributors
